{"3410410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ApocaShift", "steam_appid": 3410410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/f96c68b9962c92b61d6299f789c7bcc2.poster.avif?t=1787620287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/f96c68b9962c92b61d6299f789c7bcc2.webm?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/f96c68b9962c92b61d6299f789c7bcc2.mp4?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ApocaShift</strong> is a brutal top-down extraction looter set after a mutant apocalypse. Every expedition into the wasteland is a race against time. Scavenge rare loot, survive mutant encounters, and fight your way out, because if you don’t extract, you lose it all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/3684cfe5b0f26bf20854f73025635a28.poster.avif?t=1787620287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/3684cfe5b0f26bf20854f73025635a28.webm?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/3684cfe5b0f26bf20854f73025635a28.mp4?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Establish Your Stronghold</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an empty plot of land and expand your base by gathering resources from your raids into the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/ca94b54b1c586b3e0208faab40e5d9f5.poster.avif?t=1787620287\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/ca94b54b1c586b3e0208faab40e5d9f5.webm?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/ca94b54b1c586b3e0208faab40e5d9f5.mp4?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scavenged materials to build and fortify your base with complete freedom. Construct defenses, crafting stations, and facilities to support your growing community. Recruit survivors with unique skills—engineers to upgrade your arsenal, medics to heal, and traders offering rare gear at a price.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense extraction raids with semi‑permadeath: lose your gear if you die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully free‑form base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workbench centered crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic mutant enemies and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep tech trees and survivor progression</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical decisions impacting alliances and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Quest and Reputation System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item tiers (Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, Mythic) with many different stat modifiers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community to chat, get support, and stay updated</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/f96c68b9962c92b61d6299f789c7bcc2.poster.avif?t=1787620287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/f96c68b9962c92b61d6299f789c7bcc2.webm?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/f96c68b9962c92b61d6299f789c7bcc2.mp4?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ApocaShift</strong> is a brutal top-down extraction looter set after a mutant apocalypse. Every expedition into the wasteland is a race against time. Scavenge rare loot, survive mutant encounters, and fight your way out, because if you don’t extract, you lose it all</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/3684cfe5b0f26bf20854f73025635a28.poster.avif?t=1787620287\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/3684cfe5b0f26bf20854f73025635a28.webm?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/3684cfe5b0f26bf20854f73025635a28.mp4?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Establish Your Stronghold</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an empty plot of land and expand your base by gathering resources from your raids into the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/ca94b54b1c586b3e0208faab40e5d9f5.poster.avif?t=1787620287\" width=1600 height=900 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/ca94b54b1c586b3e0208faab40e5d9f5.webm?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3410410/extras/ca94b54b1c586b3e0208faab40e5d9f5.mp4?t=1787620287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your scavenged materials to build and fortify your base with complete freedom. Construct defenses, crafting stations, and facilities to support your growing community. Recruit survivors with unique skills—engineers to upgrade your arsenal, medics to heal, and traders offering rare gear at a price.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense extraction raids with semi‑permadeath: lose your gear if you die</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully free‑form base building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Workbench centered crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic mutant enemies and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep tech trees and survivor progression</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical decisions impacting alliances and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Quest and Reputation System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item tiers (Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, Mythic) with many different stat modifiers</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Community</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord community to chat, get support, and stay updated</p>", "short_description": "ApocaShi